{"id":"salsa","lemma":"salsa","pos":"noun","rank":1670,"glosses":["sauce, gravy (liquid condiment)","A sauce and/or dip of varying textures with a typical base of tomatoes, onion, and chili peppers.","salsa (style of music)"],"ipa":"/ˈsalsa/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"salsas"},"order":1718,"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/5a/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-salsa.wav","examples":[{"text":"Prueba esta salsa.","en":"Try this sauce.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/441255","words":[{"g":"proof"},{"g":"this","l":"este"},null]},{"text":"La variedad es la salsa de la vida.","en":"Variety is the spice of life.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/306329","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"variety"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"the / her"},null,null,null,{"g":"life"}],"phrases":[[5,7,"of the"]]},{"text":"Eso no es sangre, es salsa de tomates.","en":"It isn't blood. It's tomato sauce.","words":[{"g":"that","l":"ése"},{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"blood"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"tomato","l":"tomate"}]}]}